{"seq":2,"slug":"force-merge-deleted-reclaim-io-throttle","title":"force merge、删除文档回收与合并 IO 限流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/lucene-elasticsearch-engine-segments-inverted-index/segment-merge-operations/force-merge-deleted-reclaim-io-throttle","wordCount":2410,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"force-merge-删除文档回收与合并-io-限流\">force merge、删除文档回收与合并 IO 限流</h1><p><code>.liv</code> 位图让删除在逻辑上瞬间生效，却把物理回收推迟到某个尚未发生的合并里。于是「删了还占盘」和「强制合并把集群 IO 打满」成为同一条链上的两个故障面：回收越激进，合并越凶，磁盘带宽越紧张。这篇文档聚焦这条链的运维侧——合并策略怎么挑段、force merge 到底回收了什么、以及 Lucene 用什么机制把合并的写入速率压在磁盘能承受的范围内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-合并的两个入口-后台策略与人工-force-merge\">核心概念：合并的两个入口——后台策略与人工 force merge</h2><p>段合并不是单一路径，而是两个相互独立的决策点，混淆它们是运维误判的常见来源。</p>\n<p><strong>后台合并</strong>由 <code>IndexWriter</code> 的 <code>MergePolicy</code> 在每次 flush 后自动调度。Lucene 的默认实现是 <code>TieredMergePolicy</code>（Apache Lucene Javadoc，<code>lucene.apache.org/core/10_0_0/core/org/apache/lucene/index/TieredMergePolicy.html</code>）：它把段按大小分层（tier），优先合并同一层中「大小相近、删除比例高」的段，合并后新段落入上一层。关键参数及 Lucene 默认值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>Lucene 默认</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>segments_per_tier</code></td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>同层最多允许的段数，超过就触发合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_merge_at_once</code></td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>一次合并最多吃进几个段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>floor_segment</code></td>\n<td>2 MB</td>\n<td>小于此尺寸的段被视作同一层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_merged_segment</code></td>\n<td>5 GB</td>\n<td>单个段的上限，超过后不再往上合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>deletes_pct_allowed</code></td>\n<td>33%</td>\n<td>段删除率超过该比例才值得为去删除而合并</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Elasticsearch 把同一套参数暴露为静态索引设置 <code>index.merge.policy.*</code>（Elastic 官方文档 <em>Merge</em>，<code>elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/index-modules-merge.html</code>），并额外提供 <code>index.merge.policy.max_merged_segment</code>（默认 5gb）与 <code>index.merge.scheduler.max_thread_count</code>（默认 <code>min(4, 处理器核数/2)</code>）。注意这是<strong>静态设置</strong>：改它需要关闭索引或重建。分层策略的直觉是让合并沿「小→大」逐级发生，使得一个 doc 在生命周期内被重写的次数约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_{\\,segments\\_per\\_tier} N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2111em;vertical-align:-0.4611em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4611em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，而不是每轮全量重写。</p>\n<p><strong>人工 force merge</strong> 走 REST API <code>POST /&lt;index&gt;/_forcemerge</code>（Elastic 官方文档 <em>Force merge API</em>，<code>elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/indices-forcemerge.html</code>）。它绕过后台策略的性价比判断，直接要求把段数压到指定上限。这不是「优化索引」的日常手段，而是一次性收尾动作，代价在下面第三节展开。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    FLUSH[&quot;flush 产生新段&quot;] --&gt; POLICY{&quot;TieredMergePolicy&lt;br/&gt;评估性价比&quot;}&#10;    POLICY --&gt;|&quot;同层段数超限&lt;br/&gt;且尺寸相近&quot;| BG[&quot;后台合并&lt;br/&gt;ConcurrentMergeScheduler 调度&quot;]&#10;    POLICY --&gt;|&quot;代价不划算&quot;| KEEP[&quot;保留当前段布局&quot;]&#10;    FM[&quot;POST /_forcemerge&quot;] --&gt; FORCE[&quot;绕过性价比&lt;br/&gt;按 max_num_segments 直接合并&quot;]&#10;    BG --&gt; RATE[&quot;合并吞吐经限流器&lt;br/&gt;受 IO 反馈约束&quot;]&#10;    FORCE --&gt; RATE&#10;    RATE --&gt; NEW[&quot;产出新段 + 提交&lt;br/&gt;旧段在提交后删除&quot;]&#10;    NEW --&gt; RECLAIM[&quot;被删 doc 与陈旧段&lt;br/&gt;此时才真正释放磁盘&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    FLUSH[\"flush 产生新段\"] --&gt; POLICY{\"TieredMergePolicy&lt;br/&gt;评估性价比\"}\n    POLICY --&gt;|\"同层段数超限&lt;br/&gt;且尺寸相近\"| BG[\"后台合并&lt;br/&gt;ConcurrentMergeScheduler 调度\"]\n    POLICY --&gt;|\"代价不划算\"| KEEP[\"保留当前段布局\"]\n    FM[\"POST /_forcemerge\"] --&gt; FORCE[\"绕过性价比&lt;br/&gt;按 max_num_segments 直接合并\"]\n    BG --&gt; RATE[\"合并吞吐经限流器&lt;br/&gt;受 IO 反馈约束\"]\n    FORCE --&gt; RATE\n    RATE --&gt; NEW[\"产出新段 + 提交&lt;br/&gt;旧段在提交后删除\"]\n    NEW --&gt; RECLAIM[\"被删 doc 与陈旧段&lt;br/&gt;此时才真正释放磁盘\"]</pre><h2 id=\"only_expunge_deletes-删除回收的最小代价路径\">only_expunge_deletes：删除回收的最小代价路径</h2><p><code>_forcemerge</code> 有两个核心参数，语义完全不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>max_num_segments=N</code>：把索引合并到每分片不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个段。它<strong>重排所有倒排数据</strong>，无论段里有没有垃圾。</li>\n<li><code>only_expunge_deletes=true</code>：只合并那些删除率超过阈值的段，其余段原样保留。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两者的差别决定了成本量级。设索引大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>、垃圾（已删 doc）占比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>重写量</mtext><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>重写量</mtext><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>S</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{重写量}_{max\\_num\\_segments} \\approx S, \\qquad \\text{重写量}_{expunge} \\approx q \\cdot S&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">重写量</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">重写量</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是删除率超阈值的那部分段。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 只有 5%–15% 时，<code>only_expunge_deletes</code> 的写盘量可能只有全量 force merge 的十分之一。这也解释了为什么 <code>delete_by_query</code> 之后的标准收尾是 <code>only_expunge_deletes=true</code> 而非 <code>max_num_segments=1</code>。</p>\n<p>阈值本身由 <code>index.merge.policy.expunge_deletes_allowed</code> 控制（Elasticsearch 文档记录其默认值为 <strong>10</strong>，即删除率超过 10% 的段才纳入去删除合并；较新版本同时提供 <code>index.merge.policy.deletes_pct_allowed</code>，默认 <strong>33.0</strong>，以运行版本文档为准）。两个参数互斥——官方文档明确 <code>only_expunge_deletes</code> 与 <code>max_num_segments</code> 同时传会直接报错。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐参数</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>批量删除后回收空间</td>\n<td><code>only_expunge_deletes=true</code></td>\n<td>只重写含垃圾的段，写放大最小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只读索引定型（如历史归档）</td>\n<td><code>max_num_segments=1</code></td>\n<td>段数压到 1，查询时省掉多段归并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引将转为只读且刚大量删除</td>\n<td>先 <code>only_expunge_deletes</code>，再评估是否 <code>max_num_segments</code></td>\n<td>分两步，避免一次吃满磁盘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入中的热索引</td>\n<td><strong>不调用 force merge</strong></td>\n<td>见下一节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"force-merge-的真实代价-写放大-临时空间与不可逆性\">force merge 的真实代价：写放大、临时空间与不可逆性</h2><p>Elastic 官方文档对 <code>_forcemerge</code> 的第一句警告是：<strong>只对只读索引调用它</strong>。原因是三重成本。</p>\n<p><strong>其一，写放大。</strong> 全量 force merge 到 <code>max_num_segments=1</code> 意味着索引的每一个字节都要被读一遍、重新编码、写一遍。倒排链在重写时会被重新组织（postings 的 delta + frame-of-reference 编码、FST 重建），CPU 消耗通常比同量级的普通写入更高。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，临时磁盘空间。</strong> 合并 N 个总大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 的段会产出一个约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 的新段，而旧段要到合并完成、提交之后才被删除，因此合并期间的峰值占用约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>peak</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{peak} \\approx 2S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">peak</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>。对 <code>max_num_segments=1</code> 而言这条最致命：一个 500 GB 的分片全量 force merge 需要约 1 TB 可用空间。空间不足会让合并失败，且失败是<strong>部分</strong>的——已合并的段保留、旧段保留，索引进入段数更多的中间态。这就是「force merge 后索引反而变大」的常见根因。</p>\n<p><strong>其三，不可逆性与落盘压力。</strong> force merge 没有撤销入口，一旦开始只能等它结束或取消。运行期间它持续占用磁盘写带宽，让同一节点上的写入和后续 flush 排队。ES 从 7.x 起对 data stream 支持 <code>POST /&lt;data-stream&gt;/_forcemerge</code>，语义是<strong>先 rollover 出新的写索引，再对旧的后备索引合并</strong>，正是为避免对新写入产生直接冲击。</p>\n<h2 id=\"io-限流-从固定-20-mb-s-到自适应反馈\">IO 限流：从固定 20 MB/s 到自适应反馈</h2><p>如果合并可以无限制地吃磁盘带宽，那么一次 force merge 就能把集群的全部写入拖垮。Lucene 在 <code>ConcurrentMergeScheduler</code> 中内置了限流器，而 Elasticsearch 在 7.0 中把旧的固定限流设置<strong>移除</strong>了。</p>\n<p>历史脉络必须记住，它常出现在老集群的迁移清单里：Elasticsearch 6.x 有 <code>indices.store.throttle.type</code>（<code>none|merge|all</code>）与 <code>indices.store.throttle.max_bytes_per_sec</code>（默认 <strong>20mb</strong>）。这套设置在 <strong>7.0 中被移除</strong>，取而代之的是基于实测 IO 的自适应限流——<code>ConcurrentMergeScheduler</code> 持续测量合并的 IO 吞吐，当实际速率超过目标值时让合并线程主动 <code>pause</code>（Lucene Javadoc，<code>ConcurrentMergeScheduler</code> 与 <code>MergeRateLimiter</code>）。所以「把 throttle 设成 20mb 压住合并」是 ES 7 之后的无效操作，配置项已不存在。</p>\n<p>限流器的数学模型很朴素。设目标速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 字节/秒，本批写入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 字节，实际耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>actual</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{actual}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">actual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>allowed</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>pause</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>allowed</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>actual</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{allowed}} = \\frac{B}{R}, \\qquad t_{\\text{pause}} = \\max\\left(0,\\; t_{\\text{allowed}} - t_{\\text{actual}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">allowed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pause</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">allowed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">actual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>合并线程写完一批就进入暂停，把长窗口的平均速率收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 附近。自适应版本额外做闭环：暂停时间连续偏高（磁盘跟不上目标速率）就把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 调低，反之逐步抬高。这就是为什么在 NVMe 集群上看不到恒定的合并速率——限流目标本身在变。这个公式也给出了容量规划下界：合并总耗时约等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>重写字节数</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{重写字节数} / R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">重写字节数</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运维账本-并发-观测与取消\">运维账本：并发、观测与取消</h2><p>合并的资源占用有三个可以显式控制的旋钮，都在静态索引设置里。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>index.merge.scheduler.max_thread_count</code>：单分片同时进行的合并线程数，默认 <code>min(4, 处理器核数/2)</code>。对机械盘或共享云盘，把它降到 1 通常比降低目标速率更有效——并发数比速率更容易预测。</li>\n<li><code>index.merge.scheduler.max_merge_count</code>：合并线程总数上限，防止大量分片同时开闸。</li>\n<li><code>index.merge.policy.*</code>：间接控制合并频率。把 <code>max_merged_segment</code> 调大能减少大段反复重写，但也会拉长单次合并的时间。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>观测面同样明确。合并的实时速率、已耗时、合并前后段数与字节数可从 <code>GET _nodes/stats/indices</code> 的 <code>merges</code> 段和 <code>GET _cat/segments/&lt;index&gt;</code> 读到；<code>_forcemerge</code> 支持 <code>wait_for_completion=false</code>，此时返回 task id，可用 <code>GET _tasks/&lt;id&gt;</code> 观察进度、<code>POST _tasks/&lt;id&gt;/_cancel</code> 取消。取消是<strong>安全</strong>的：合并要么完整提交产出新段，要么被丢弃，不存在写坏一半的中间段——这正是段不可变带来的好处，与 <a href=\"../lucene-segment-write-model/write-path-buffer-refresh-flush-translog\">写入路径与 translog</a> 里「先写新文件再原子提交」是同一套机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"电商索引的合并运维清单\">电商索引的合并运维清单</h2><p>把上面的机制落到典型的跨境电商搜索集群上，可以固化成几条判断规则。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>商品主索引在重建后合并，不在写入期合并。</strong> 常见做法是每日重建到新索引，写入完成后 <code>index.blocks.write</code> 置为只读、<code>_forcemerge?max_num_segments=1</code>、再切换别名。这样代价可预测，且不影响线上写。</li>\n<li><strong><code>delete_by_query</code> 之后只做 <code>only_expunge_deletes=true</code>。</strong> 大促结束清理过期活动商品、或按条件下架失效 SKU 后，垃圾率通常远低于 33%，全量 force merge 属于浪费磁盘带宽。</li>\n<li><strong>先看垃圾率再决定是否回收。</strong> 用 <code>_cat/segments</code> 的 <code>docs.deleted</code> 算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>live</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q = d/(N_{\\text{live}}+d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">live</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q &lt; 10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span> 时去删除合并通常不划算——后台策略迟早会吃掉这些段。</li>\n<li><strong>为合并预留 2 倍分片空间的磁盘余量。</strong> 磁盘使用率超过 55%–60% 就应谨慎安排 force merge，超过 70% 直接不做。</li>\n<li><strong>别把 force merge 当搜索提速的通用药。</strong> 段数从 30 压到 1 主要节省的是查询期的多段归并开销；对每分片只有十几个段的索引，收益常小于它带来的写放大。合并收益的上限由查询执行路径决定，可参考 <a href=\"../search-scoring-execution/query-execution-iterator-collector-pipeline\">查询执行与收集器流水线</a> 对多段遍历成本的描述。</li>\n<li><strong>回收的本质是「让新段不含死 doc」。</strong> 这与 <a href=\"../lucene-segment-write-model/document-update-delete-tombstone-versioning\">墓碑、软删除与版本并发控制</a> 里 <code>liveDocs</code> 位图的语义严格对应：合并读位图、只把 bit=1 的 doc 写入新段。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>一句话总结这条链：<strong>删除决定「逻辑上不可见」，合并决定「物理上消失」，限流决定「消失的过程有多贵」</strong>。三者任意一个被误配，都会以「磁盘只增不减」或「写入被合并拖慢」的形式暴露出来。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"参考来源\">参考来源</h2><ul>\n<li>Apache Lucene Javadoc — <code>TieredMergePolicy</code> / <code>ConcurrentMergeScheduler</code> / <code>MergeRateLimiter</code>：<code>lucene.apache.org/core/10_0_0/core/org/apache/lucene/index/</code></li>\n<li>Elastic 官方文档 <em>Force merge API</em>：<code>elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/indices-forcemerge.html</code></li>\n<li>Elastic 官方文档 <em>Merge</em>（<code>index.merge.policy.*</code> / <code>index.merge.scheduler.*</code>）：<code>elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/index-modules-merge.html</code></li>\n<li>Elastic 官方文档 <em>Delete by query API</em>：<code>elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/docs-delete-by-query.html</code></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>默认值随版本演进（本文参照 Elasticsearch 9.x / Lucene 10.x），部署前以运行版本官方页为准。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"force merge、删除文档回收与合并 IO 限流","id":"force-merge-删除文档回收与合并-io-限流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：合并的两个入口——后台策略与人工 force merge","id":"核心概念-合并的两个入口-后台策略与人工-force-merge"},{"level":2,"text":"only_expunge_deletes：删除回收的最小代价路径","id":"only_expunge_deletes-删除回收的最小代价路径"},{"level":2,"text":"force merge 的真实代价：写放大、临时空间与不可逆性","id":"force-merge-的真实代价-写放大-临时空间与不可逆性"},{"level":2,"text":"IO 限流：从固定 20 MB/s 到自适应反馈","id":"io-限流-从固定-20-mb-s-到自适应反馈"},{"level":2,"text":"运维账本：并发、观测与取消","id":"运维账本-并发-观测与取消"},{"level":2,"text":"电商索引的合并运维清单","id":"电商索引的合并运维清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"参考来源","id":"参考来源"}],"prev":{"title":"段合并策略与分级合并：merge policy 与段尺寸模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/lucene-elasticsearch-engine-segments-inverted-index/segment-merge-operations/merge-policy-tiered-segment-sizing"},"next":{"title":"合并风暴、hot_threads 诊断与分片容量治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/lucene-elasticsearch-engine-segments-inverted-index/segment-merge-operations/merge-storm-hot-threads-shard-capacity-ops"}}